  "comments": [
    {"at":0,"placement":"line","text":"Sets instrument A on voice X from music_instrument_ptrs: waveform, pulse width and modulation, ADSR, slide, octave and filter. Called from the pattern reader at $0b37."},
    {"at":24,"placement":"side","text":"Only the pulse waveform reads pulse width bytes"},
    {"at":49,"placement":"side","text":"Below $80 the LFO of voice X is used, not the byte value"},
    {"at":67,"placement":"line","text":"Envelope, slide step, octave offset and filter flag. Without filter the voice leaves the filter."},
    {"at":97,"placement":"side","text":"Filter flag 0: the voice leaves the filter"},
    {"at":192,"placement":"line","text":"Steps the three triangle LFOs in music_mod_values between 0 and $ff, and copies ENV3 and OSC3 into slots 3 and 4. Called each frame from $0aa8."},
    {"at":201,"placement":"side","text":"Slot 4: no instrument selects it"},
    {"at":258,"placement":"line","text":"Sets the pulse width of each modulated voice to base + (LFO << music_pwm_shift). Called each frame from $0aab."},
    {"at":305,"placement":"line","text":"Writes the cutoff: base plus or minus (modulator << music_filter_shift) when music_filter_source is positive. Called each frame from $0aae."},
    {"at":335,"placement":"side","text":"Direction 1 subtracts; only instrument 21 of tune 4 has it"},
    {"at":340,"placement":"side","text":"16-bit sum, but the SID uses only bits 0-2 of CUTLO"},
    {"at":375,"placement":"line","text":"Moves the current frequency of voice X toward the note frequency by (slide step << note octave) and stops at the note. Called from $0a93."}
  ],
